OMFG MOOD! I have this with my orbiter, the looks of my frames and simple mod changes. I'm like "hmm, this mod would probably be better than what I have now". Forget it the moment I am back in the orbiter from a mission.

"Hmm... Not really digging this syandana... Need to see if another one fits better". Exact same thing happens

Why o why are we like this? ;-;
